{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": ""}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Programming Issues"}, {"type": "position", "content": 12}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 3}, {"type": "level", "content": "A1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear and use when you talk about programming issues."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Understand key information about the concepts, principles, and methodologies in simple spoken and written situations.  Read and write about programming techniques, use cases, kinds, and sequences in simple spoken and written situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures. Writes simple but clear texts describing or reviewing places to visit in the region, using an appropriate range of vocabulary and grammatical structures."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "enpe7n2le03ob12re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Simple Present Tense and Present Continuous"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use the <strong>Simple Present</strong> to express the idea that an action is repeated or usual. The action can be a habit, a hobby, a daily event, a scheduled event or something that often happens. <br/>You use <strong>Present Continuous</strong> to express a current action or to indicate a possible action in the near future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<strong>Simple Present structure:</strong><br/><br/>Noun + present tense verb + complement<br/><br/>Examples:<br/><br/><span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"italic\">program</span> Java at the office.<br/><br/>Steph <span class=\"strong\">uses</span> C++ language.</span><br/><br/><strong>Present continuous:</strong><br/><br/>Verb to be + verb ING form + complement<br/><br/>Examples: </br><span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">am working</span> on the programming issues this weekend.<br/><br/>Pablo <span class=\"strong\">is coding</span> the new software program."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I am working on some programming issues. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I want to solve them as soon as possible."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I try to solve it alone."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Indefinite Pronouns"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "We use <strong>indefinite pronouns</strong> to refer to people or things without saying exactly who or what they are. We use pronouns ending in -body or -one for people, and pronouns ending in -thing for things:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Next is a chart with examples of indefinite pronouns:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Noun\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Indefinite pronoun\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I would like to go <strong>to Paris</strong> this summer.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I would like to go <strong>somewhere</strong> this summer.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<strong>Jim</strong> gave me this book.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<strong>Someone</strong> gave me this book.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I won't tell your secret to <strong>Sam.</strong>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I won't tell your secret to <strong>anyone.</strong>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I bought <strong>my school supplies</strong> at the mall.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I bought <strong>everything</strong> at the mall.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "It's part of everyone's job."}, {"type": "example", "content": "They are working on something different. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Not anybody can solve some issues."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "python "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "is a programming language "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The problems in JavaScript are different from Python. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe7n2le03ob12aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "come up "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to appear or happen, to occur"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: I am working on some programming issues that came up this morning."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe7n2le03ob12aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "frustrated "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "disappointed, discouraged "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Sometimes, I get frustrated when errors show up in my programming."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe7n2le03ob12aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "patient "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "calm, gentle "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's about being patient."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe7n2le03ob12aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "updated "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " modern, renovated "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It is important to keep updated on everything you can."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe7n2le03ob12aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "expert "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a proficient or skillful person "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I learn from the experts."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe7n2le03ob12aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Investigate a common programming issues from 10 years ago. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write the differences between the issues from the past and the current ones "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share your findings with your teacher and classmates"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I investigate about programming issues "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write and describe programming issues"}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about programming issues with my teacher and classmates"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "enpe7n2le03ob12re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<strong>Lisa</strong>:I always expect certain issues in programming.<br/>\n<strong>Joanne</strong>: I know Lisa. The difficulty of programming, of course, depends on the programming language you use. For example, the issues in Java are different from C++ or the problems in JavaScript are different from Python. Actually, I am working on some programming issues that came up this morning and I want to solve them as soon as possible.<br/>\n<strong>Lisa</strong>: I agree. Some issues take different measures. Sometimes, I get frustrated when errors show up in my programming; not anybody can solve some issues."}, {"time": "34500", "image": "enpe7n2le03ob12re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<strong>Joanne</strong>: It's part of everyone's job to solve the programming issues and errors. What do you do when you get a message error?<br/>\n<strong>Lisa</strong>: First, I try to solve it alone. Then, I ask for references from programmers and coworkers or experts, but when I can solve an issue, I will remember the solution that I learn from the experts. The programmers are solving issues all the time, but the issues always appear. Once you solve an issue, it will be easier in the future, so it's about being patient. Are the programmers helping you solve those issues?"}, {"time": "73000", "image": "enpe7n2le03ob12re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<strong>Joanne</strong>: Right now, no. They are working on something different, but I have to finish this before lunch. The computer needs to execute the program so we can continue with other issues. <br/>\n<strong>Lisa</strong>: Would you like to share any additional information about programming issues?<br/>\n<strong>Joanne</strong>: You should learn new skills and programming techniques all the time and learn from everybody; investigate about new tools and new programming languages. They are changing every day, so it is important to keep updated on everything you can."}], "coverimg": "enpe7n2le03ob12re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "enpe7n2le03ob12re2aud01"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}, {"template_override": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"video_src": "enpe7n2le03ob12re5vsc01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": ""}]}, "type": "video"}], "type": "video", "_data": [], "id": 3, "title": ""}], "exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can read about programming issues. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "  I can write a short paragraph about programming issues. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "  I can explain some programming issues by